nt":0,"thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/280x280/ts/product/b4/12/d7/15d56f98e6a108b3d8799d58a5876f09.png","has_ebook":false,"inventory_status":"available","inventory_type":"backorder","productset_group_name":"","is_fresh":false,"seller":null,"is_flower":false,"has_buynow":true,"is_gift_card":false,"salable_type":null,"data_version":3300,"day_ago_created":770,"all_time_quantity_sold":5,"meta_title":"","meta_description":"","meta_keywords":"","is_baby_milk":false,"is_acoholic_drink":false,"description":"<p>Với phong cảnh núi non và sa mạc, những khu chợ mê cung, ẩm thực ngon, những tấm thảm và hàng dệt may tinh tế, những bức tranh ghép sống động, mùi thơm, âm nhạc mê hoặc và chào đón mọi người, Ma-rốc là một điểm đến kỳ lạ đầy quyến rũ và trêu ngươi.</p>\n<p>Though it lies just across the Mediterranean from Europe, barely a stone's throw from Spain's southernmost tip, Morocco couldn't possibly be farther away.</p>\n<p>With its mountainous and desert landscapes, labyrinthine souks, delectable cuisine, exquisite rugs and textiles, vibrant mosaics, fragrant odors, mesmerizing music, and welcoming people, Morocco is a most alluring and tantalizingly exotic destination. Digging a little deeper into the myth of Morocco, Barbara and Rene Stoeltie bring us this eclectic selection of homes to demonstrate all that is most wonderful about the Moroccan style: from tiled, turquoise swimming pools and lavish gardens to carved wooden furniture and jade-colored marble fountains.</p>\n<p>With more than 500 pages featuring stunning, inspiring photographs, flipping through these fairy tale-like visions of exotic havens (ideally while sipping a steaming cup of sweet, fragrant mint tea) will instantly whisk you away.</p>\n<p>About the series</p>\n<p>TASCHEN is 40! Since we started our work as cultural archaeologists in 1980, TASCHEN has become synonymous with accessible publishing, helping bookworms around the world curate their own library of art, anthropology, and aphrodisia at an unbeatable price. Today we celebrate 40 years of incredible books by staying true to our company credo. The 40 series presents new editions of some of the stars of our program-now more compact, friendly in price, and still realized with the same commitment to impeccable production.</p><p>Giá sản phẩm trên Tiki đã bao gồm thuế theo luật hiện hành. Bên cạnh đó, tuỳ vào loại sản phẩm, hình thức và địa chỉ giao hàng mà có thể phát sinh thêm chi phí khác như phí vận chuyển, phụ phí hàng cồng kềnh, thuế nhập khẩu (đối với đơn hàng giao từ nước ngoài có giá trị trên 1 triệu đồng).....</p>","images":[{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/b4/12/d7/15d56f98e6a108b3d8799d58a5876f09.png","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/b4/12/d7/15d56f98e6a108b3d8799d58a5876f09.png","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/b4/12/d7/15d56f98e6a108b3d8799d58a5876f09.png","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/b4/12/d7/15d56f98e6a108b3d8799d58a5876f09.png","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/b4/12/d7/15d56f98e6a108b3d8799d58a5876f09.png"},{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/0e/38/b4/733686a5a886567dd9428cafa9f50684.jpg","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/0e/38/b4/733686a5a886567dd9428cafa9f50684.jpg","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/0e/38/b4/733686a5a886567dd9428cafa9f50684.jpg","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/0e/38/b4/733686a5a886567dd9428cafa9f50684.jpg","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/0e/38/b4/733686a5a886567dd9428cafa9f50684.jpg"},{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/ce/47/de/b6a4ccf86375974a1e7f33c89cf4e459.jpg","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/ce/47/de/b6a4ccf86375974a1e7f33c89c